			title: "UIV Integration"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 38.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7BA44754AA7803E8"]
			description: ["Polarised helium-3 on helium-3 gives two protons and a helium nucleus. The plasma is the energy: a direct converter takes it as current. A formed Mk5 ring, polarised helium-3 from the polariser, and a buffer big enough for the start energy. The first of three Mk5 power sources for the gate to UXV. Helium-3 in by bus; the protons go back to the polarised source."]
			icon: "gtceu:he3he3_plasma_bucket"
			id: "5CFB2BEA56673819"
			rewards: [{ id: "7242FEAF7C398654", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "7FD9137C86733640", item: "gtceu:helium3_polariser", type: "item" }
				{ id: "161B4F9F1C4EDC23", item: "gtceu:he3he3_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "First Mk5 Burn"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5CFB2BEA56673819"]
			description: ["Polarised lithium hydride pellets burn to helium and a second plasma. The ash still holds helium-3, so it goes through the superfluid plant once more. The same ring and converter, and polarised lithium-6 hydride pellets. A second source that burns no helium-3. Pellets by bus from the polarised source; the helium-3 in the ash returns to the first burn."]
			icon: "gtceu:pli6_plasma_bucket"
			id: "302777116673DBF1"
			rewards: [{ id: "7F5EC3A50995DC33", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "1EBD1ACD0A754578", item: "gtceu:pli6_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Lithium Burn"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["302777116673DBF1"]
			description: ["Protons on nitrogen-15 are the hottest fuel and give the most current per ring. The ash is carbon-12, which the diamond lines take. Polarised ammonia ice pellets and a ring with the full set of hatches. The strongest Mk5 source, and the carbon for diamond. Send the carbon-12 straight to the diamond lattice fab."]
			icon: "gtceu:pn15_plasma_bucket"
			id: "16B25F9750E5C09E"
			rewards: [{ id: "3239BCCB3D2A89CB", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7A5A84CB7D154A19", item: "gtceu:pn15_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitrogen Burn"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16B25F9750E5C09E"]
			description: ["The &6Direct Energy Converter&r takes the three Mk5 plasmas as new rows. Its output is written final, so no generator array doubles it. The converter from ZPM and a plasma line for each burn. The Mk5 figures on the Power tab. Plasma by pipe from the ring; keep the converter's hatches free of anything else."]
			icon: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter"
			id: "360709C0A42E7094"
			rewards: [{ id: "592BB1C698306BA7", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7BEF3B769EB21ECE", item: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter", type: "item" }]
			title: "Written Final"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17B06879E2354DD6"]
			description: ["The &6UIV Parallel Control Hatch&r lets a mega machine run more copies of a recipe at once than the UEV one. Energy is still the limit: every copy pays its own EU/t. A machine with a parallel slot and the power for every copy. Wide runs on the Neutronium Compression Hall and the other mega machines. Feed the machine a bus wide enough for the copies it runs."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_parallel_hatch"
			id: "36B8D9937001B17B"
			rewards: [{ id: "533D3582C8F64093", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5C00DDA87A1C0F57", item: "gtceu:uiv_parallel_hatch", type: "item" }]
			title: "Parallel Control"
			x: 9.0d
			y: 35.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17B06879E2354DD6"]
			description: ["The &6UIV SMES Cell&r holds four times what the UEV cell does, in metallic hydrogen windings. The nitride magnet works from UEV and a pulsar-timed repeater to keep the network in step. The UIV wireless tier. Nothing to feed. Size the towers for your busiest hour."]
			icon: "grindless:uiv_smes_cell"
			id: "5FB006B879741A02"
			rewards: [{ id: "34D47AB6E85C7F74", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "58CF3B6EE938CE16", item: "grindless:uiv_smes_cell", type: "item" }
				{ id: "578E496B41D9D69C", item: "grindless:pulsar_timed_repeater", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The UIV Cell"
			x: 9.0d
			y: 37.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FB006B879741A02"]
			description: ["Move your towers onto &6UIV SMES Cells&r and the wireless network carries UIV to every station, out to the black hole. One formed tower holding a UIV cell: the network runs at its strongest cell, so until then it stays at UEV. The wireless hatches at UIV, and the gate's load for UXV. Add cells when the network dips at your busiest hour."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "7099122F58BD069C"
			rewards: [{ id: "38CA6305A7C48B92", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "39D503CFF6676726", item: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "32EA26BD8F6C35EE", item: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_dynamo_hatch", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The Network Goes UIV"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 37.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7099122F58BD069C"]
			description: ["The gate to UXV needs 536,870,912 EU/t for sixty seconds, and the bank loses five per cent on the way in. Two Mk5 rings and a Penrose engine close the sum; four rings do it without the engine. The Power tab shows each source."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "122504D2A2BC2235"
			rewards: [{ id: "5E3CF3C809F8C206", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
