			x: 11.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17B06879E2354DD6"]
			description: ["The &6Hot Strip Mill&r, &6Powder Bed Printer&r, &6Electron-Beam Furnace&r, &6Plasma Quench Caster&r, &6Megabar Press&r and &6CVI Furnace&r each take a mode: a canned RHEA slab, an impeller, refined niobium and tin, a sprayed first wall, compacted canisters and a tungsten fibre preform. The controllers you already own and the new alloys. The RHEA parts, the Mk5 first wall and the sleds. Slabs and preforms by bus; recycle the powder that is not sintered."]
			icon: "gtceu:hot_strip_mill"
			id: "36380573A891A925"
