		{
			dependencies: ["5069E4BF6AB5AF97"]
			description: ["The &6Gravitational-Wave Detector&r, &6Event Horizon Interferometer&r, &6Deep Space Network&r and &6Pulsar Timing Station&r take a row each: a ringdown record, a correlated Kerr record, timed pulse profiles and a clock discipline. The probe data from Cygnus X-1 and the profiles from the pulsar. The Kerr chart and the navigation solution. Records come home by ME; the Matrioshka takes them from there."]
