		{
			dependencies: ["50ED516A490F0DF7"]
			description: ["The &6Ramp Compression Pulser&r squeezes cold hydrogen until it turns metallic. The squeeze is real; the quench is fiction, as nobody has kept metallic hydrogen once the pressure is gone. A UIV hull, the UEV casing and the coilgun coil casing that pulses the pressure. Metallic hydrogen, and lonsdaleite and cubic gauche nitrogen beside it. Hydrogen by pipe; spent shards return to the cryogenic plant, so loop them."]
			icon: "gtceu:ramp_compression_pulser"
			id: "13765E3D3D991767"
			rewards: [{ id: "331AA54A80D9B591", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
