		{
			dependencies: ["50ED516A490F0DF7"]
			description: ["A melt held in the air by a magnetic field never touches a crucible, so nothing dissolves into it. The &6Levitation Melter&r pours RHEA and the alloys that crucibles ruin. A UIV hull, the UEV casing and a levitation trap. The RHEA ingot, and the glass and tile lines that start from it. Alloy powders by ME; the beryllium fume is captured, so route the scrubber output."]
			icon: "gtceu:levitation_melter"
			id: "386B4A8A0B37927E"
