				{ id: "5268F067E9039C63", item: "gtceu:uiv_machine_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Matrioshka Computer"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 29.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2EF99503F9DB02"]
			description: ["Heat has nowhere to go in space but out. Liquid tin droplets falling in free fall carry it away, which only works in orbit. The &6Droplet Radiator Works&r builds the modules. A UIV hull, UIV components and the UIV casing; the modules need no particular place. Radiator modules, and the TPV tiles of the Matrioshka shell. Tin overflow returns to stock; ship modules down by ME."]
