		{
			dependencies: ["3DF069B74A45CB2C"]
			description: ["Deep in the crust the nuclei are so crowded that neutrons leak out between them. The &6Neutron Drip Separator&r takes them away before the matter relaxes. A UIV hull, the UIV casing and the neutron star site casing. Drip neutrons, for the cage and for the r-process. Drip neutrons decay if you wait, so pipe them straight to the next machine."]
			icon: "gtceu:neutron_drip_separator"
