		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["Cool the drip neutrons into a superfluid and shut it in a cage. The &6Neutronium Cage&r makes the pellet, which is fiction: a spoonful of neutron matter held at ordinary pressure by a field. A UIV hull, the UIV casing, the neutron star site casing and a coil cage. The neutronium pellet, which the gate store asks for and the compression hall reads. Drip neutrons by pipe; keep pellets by ME, as the hall never uses them up."]
			icon: "gtceu:neutronium_cage"
