			dependencies: ["5FF5D83E309497C2"]
			description: ["A pulsar blows a wind of electrons and positrons. The &6Pulsar Wind Trap&r catches a sample in a tungsten-lined magnet, and the gamma rays heat the lining. A UIV hull and the UIV casing, with a lining that takes the heat. Pair plasma, which the condensate lab cools. Pair plasma stays sealed; pipe it to the lab and cool the lining."]
