		{
			dependencies: ["7149EBF20BBEB79E"]
			description: ["An electron and a positron orbiting each other, laser-cooled in aerogel until they act as one. The &6Positronium Condensate Lab&r makes the Ps BEC. Nobody has made one yet, so this one is a proposal. A UIV hull, the UIV casing and the cryostat casing. The Ps BEC, and with it the gamma laser cavity of the UIV emitter. Aerogel by ME and pair plasma by pipe; run two labs, because the condensate is short-lived."]
			icon: "gtceu:positronium_condensate_lab"
