			description: ["The &6Penrose Engine&r drops a sled into the ergosphere. The sled splits, one half falls in and the other comes out with more energy than it took in. The hole spins a little slower. It is fiction. A UIV hull and the UIV casing, with a sled loaded at the probe bay. Power for the gate load, and the recovered half-sled for the gate store. Sleds by ME; send each recovered half back to the bay for a refit."]
